**Ukrashan** (/' *u:krɑʃən* /, [[ukrashan|Ukrashan]]: *𐒓𐒏𐒇𐒖𐒉𐒗𐒒*) is the language spoken in the areas of: [[ukrasha|Ukrasha]] and the [[xoseon-steppes|Xoseon Steppes]].

